Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:41:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(server): Claude usage limits on CLI 2.1.30x and
 throttled probes

Touches: apps/server/src/provider/claudeUsageLimits.ts (+ its test).

- A get_usage response with rate_limits_available=true but rate_limits=null
  means the CLI could not reach the usage endpoint (Anthropic throttles it).
  Report it as probeFailed instead of unsupported: "unsupported" told the UI
  the account has no limits and made applyUsageLimitsUpdate drop every
  streamed update for the session.
- CLI 2.1.30x rate_limit_event carries all windows under unifiedWindows with
  no top-level utilization; read them so 5h/weekly fill in after each turn.

Drop this patch once upstream handles both.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
